WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.950
In Acts, Paul tells the people of Athens he
found an altar with a strange inscription.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.990
It read: To an unknown god.

3
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:13.270
Paul starts there, with what
the Athenians already sense.

4
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:20.120
Centuries later, in 1934, two theologians
fell out bitterly over this same question.

5
00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:23.520
Can you work out that God
exists by looking at the world,

6
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.930
or must God show himself?

7
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.520
In this mission, you'll explore
an inner sense of the divine,

8
00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.520
and the order of creation.

9
00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.850
Then you'll see what Christians say faith,

10
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.200
grace and the Spirit reveal,
and weigh up both routes.

11
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.910
Your mission: find out what
reason might show about God,

12
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.360
and what Christians say needs revelation.
